      "name": "On 20 November 2026 we published client SDKs at 0.1.0 as…",
      "text": "On 20 November 2026 we published client SDKs at 0.1.0 as early access releases: `@nulldull/sdk` for Node.js, `@nulldull/react`, `nulldull` for Python, a Go module, `NullDull` for Swift and `com.nulldull:nulldull-sdk` for Kotlin. Their source is open under the MIT license at [github.com/doubco/nulldull-sdks](https://github.com/doubco/nulldull-sdks).",
